    "created_at": "2016-02-26T23:28:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-26T23:28:54Z",
    "body": "That text in \"the details element\" section makes me think that we should merge the new style of \"summary\" into that section, and rename it to \"the details element and the summary element\".\n\nOne thing suddently came to me about `details` that, is the collapsing of details element animatable? From the current text, it doesn't seem to, but I suppose authors would want to do this. Not sure how to make it possible.\n",
